{"ID":86666,"post_author":"2711","post_date":"2022-07-21 16:39:12","post_date_gmt":"2022-07-21 15:39:12","post_content":"","post_title":"Vitalidad en la menopausia","post_excerpt":"","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","post_password":"","post_name":"encuentros-de-tantra-para-todos","to_ping":"","pinged":"","post_modified":"2025-04-17 14:26:39","post_modified_gmt":"2025-04-17 13:26:39","post_content_filtered":"","post_parent":0,"guid":"https:\/\/www.erescambio.com\/?bloque_texto=encuentros-de-tantra-para-todos","menu_order":0,"post_type":"bloque_texto","post_mime_type":"","comment_count":"0","filter":"raw","author":"2711","id":86666,"individual":false,"acf":{"texto_a_mostrar":"libre","texto":"<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>Vive esta etapa con plenitud y seguridad<br \/>\n<\/strong><\/span>Para mujeres en menopausia que quieren equilibrar su energ\u00eda, conectar con su fuerza interna y redefinir su bienestar con confianza.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>Estructura del programa:<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">1 taller grupal inicial (3 horas)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">7 sesiones grupales semanales (90 min c\/u)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">1 sesiones individuales (60 min c\/u)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Material complementario: meditaciones, ejercicios de qigong y bioenerg\u00e9tica<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>Duraci\u00f3n<\/strong><strong>:<\/strong> 14&#8217;5 horas<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>Precio<\/strong><strong>:<\/strong> 340 \u20ac &#8211; Si escoges 2 pagos de 170\u20ac<br \/>\n\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 280 \u20ac &#8211; Si escoges pago \u00fanico<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>Calendario del programa:<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>Taller grupal:<\/strong> S\u00e1bado 10\/02\/2025 de 10h a 13h<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>Sesiones semanales:<\/strong> Los mi\u00e9rcoles, desde el 14\/05\/25 hasta el 25\/06 (ambos inclusive), de 19:30h a 21:00h<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>Sesi\u00f3n individual: <\/strong>A realizar entre el 14\/05\/25 y el 25\/06\/25 (en fecha y horario a convenir)<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>\u00bfQuieres saber m\u00e1s?<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">Escr\u00edbeme para reservar una <strong>sesi\u00f3n gratuita de 20 minutos<\/strong> donde resolveremos todas tus dudas.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","boton":"Quiero una sesi\u00f3n gratuita","url_boton":"https:\/\/api.whatsapp.com\/send?phone=34630127319&text=Hola%20Gemma%2C%20estoy%20en%20tu%20p%C3%A1gina%20web%20y%20me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20recibir%20m%C3%A1s%20informaci%C3%B3n%20sobre%20tus%20servicios.%20","abrir_en_nueva_ventana":true,"imagen_a_mostrar":"libre","imagenes_laterales":{"imagen_izquierda":false,"imagen_central":false,"imagen_derecha":{"ID":170071,"id":170071,"title":"Programa menopausia","filename":"programa-menopausia.jpg","filesize":402778,"url":"https:\/\/cdn.erescambio.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/programa-menopausia.jpg","link":"https:\/\/www.erescambio.com\/bloque_texto\/encuentros-de-tantra-para-todos\/cheerful-senior-woman-brisk-walking-in-winter\/","alt":"","author":"2711","description":"","caption":"Vitalidad en la menopausia","name":"cheerful-senior-woman-brisk-walking-in-winter","status":"inherit","uploaded_to":86666,"date":"2025-04-13 14:36:18","modified":"2025-04-14 08:34:20","menu_order":0,"mime_type":"image\/jpeg","type":"image","subtype":"jpeg","icon":"https:\/\/www.erescambio.com\/wp-includes\/images\/media\/default.png","width":667,"height":1000,"sizes":{"thumbnail":